Reproduction
Set GODOT to the Godot 4.6.3 executable. Set XDG_DATA_HOME, XDG_CONFIG_HOME,
and XDG_CACHE_HOME to existing writable test directories, then run from checkout:
  bash tools/test.sh
  bash tools/test_hometown.sh
  bash tools/test-youth-ui.sh
  bash tools/calibrate-combat.sh
  bash tools/export.sh
The aggregate, font/input/calibration and export commands above all exited 0
on the final runtime source. No SCRIPT ERROR, Parse Error or ERROR lines occurred.

